{"candidateAnswer":"Sometime in late 2022","evidence":"[D12:2 | 3:09 pm on 8 October, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, tough news. Yeah, our health can really put a damper on things. I started lifting weights one year ago and it's been a journey. It was a struggle at first, but I'm seeing some gains. You interested in trying it out?","itemId":"urn:uuid:c8702f55-e122-590c-ad1b-ed472ac91525","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5de8e24e973a48b9a2199505e9450cb508bda8d5f1d88dd666140529001e3406","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Evan start lifting weights?","referenceAnswer":"October 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5de8e24e973a48b9a2199505e9450cb508bda8d5f1d88dd666140529001e3406"}}]}